@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Contact Us";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    DohFlo is a software portfolio project created by Boolie Kets for review by
    potential employers, recruiters, and professional contacts.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Professional inquiries</h2>
<p>
    If this demonstration was shared with you through a job application,
    recruiting platform, or professional message, please reply through that same
    contact method. This helps protect personal contact information from spam.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Technical feedback</h2>
<p>
    Constructive feedback about usability, accessibility, code organization,
    or application behavior is welcome. Please do not include passwords, account
    numbers, financial records, or other sensitive information in a message.
</p>

<h2 class="h4 mt-4">Support notice</h2>
<p>
    DohFlo is not a commercial service and does not provide financial support,
    account recovery for the public, or emergency assistance.
</p>
